types_of_online_tax_letters_h1=Online tax letters
types_of_online_tax_letters_p1=Online tax letters are the easiest way for us to keep in touch. But we want to make sure you never miss one, so we will also write to you by post if:
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_1=we send an email, but it does not reach you and is returned to us
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_2=you have not done something important that needs doing
types_of_online_tax_letters_p2=This service is still growing, so at the moment we only send some tax letters online. This is changing, so soon all your important tax letters will be in one place.
types_of_online_tax_letters_h2=Tax letters you can get online
types_of_online_tax_letters_h3_1=Employees
types_of_online_tax_letters_h3_2=Making Tax Digital for Income Tax
types_of_online_tax_letters_p_1=You will get an online letter if you:
types_of_online_tax_letters_p_2=You will get an online tax letter if you:
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_3=owe tax or are due a refund (P800, PA302)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_4=have a new tax code (P2)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_5=have a new tax statement (SA300 / SS300)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_6=need to file a tax return (SA316)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_7=need a reminder to file a tax return (SA372-30; SA372-60; SA373-30; SA373-60)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_8=have a tax return that is late (SA326D; SA328D)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_9=owe a payment and it’s late (SA359)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_10=must pay a penalty (SA370; SA371)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_11=have a tax refund (R002A)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_12=have a new tax summary (ATSV2)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_13=have Self Assessment stopped (SA251)
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_14=must submit your final declaration
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_15=must send your annual update
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_16=must send your quarterly update
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_17=must make a ‘payment on account’
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_18=will need to make ‘payments on account’
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_19=have end of statement reminders
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_20=have final declaration reminders
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_21=have quarterly update reminders
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_22=have ‘payment on account’ reminders
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_23=have a ‘payment on account’ charge notice
types_of_online_tax_letters_list_24=have not viewed your calculation after it’s updated

